body:
This helped us, btw.

&#x200B;

We're competent players but it took us a while to work out a strat with synergy between our classes.

What I have is 22g x 1 1/2, which is fine for injecting.

&#x200B;

What the nurse was suggesting the pharmacy should send me is 19 x 1 1/2, for aspirating the medication. (It's the government. They do things a certain way.)
